<title>POLAND: STALPRODUKT SWINGS TO LOSS IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>STALPRODUKT SWINGS TO LOSS IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.45 vs   1.52</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.36 vs   2.18</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.36 vs   2.36</p>
<p> Sales		   32.57 vs  23.81</p>
<p> JANUARY-JUNE	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.91 vs  10.86</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.07 vs  15.62</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.29 vs  15.63</p>
<p> Sales		  170.82 vs 145.36</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish steel products maker is</p>
<p>Stalprodukt SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
